_:n7a2a2d5a70744cec9275b2e2bd998220b102 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#overallintent_instance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man in traditional attire with a head covering, smiling and gesturing with open hands. The text overlay reads: 'when you're feeling horny asf but your habibi is on periods let's try a goat.' The overall intent is to create humor through a crude, sexually suggestive scenario involving a partner on their period and a humorous, absurd solution involving a goat. The meme uses juxtaposition to mock the situation, implying a lack of options or a humorous resignation to absurdity. The visual element of the man's traditional clothing and head covering may be used to stereotype or associate him with a specific cultural or religious group, potentially contributing to harmful or offensive implications. The meme contains harmful content by trivializing a sensitive personal situation (periods) and promoting a crude, animalistic solution, which can be seen as misogynistic and degrading. The intent is to provoke laughter through shock value and absurdity, but the content may be offensive to some viewers due to its crude nature and potential for reinforcing negative stereotypes."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Shadow-glowEffect> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#deprecated> "true"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
