<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A man with a dark beard and mustache, wearing a white head covering (possibly a keffiyeh or similar traditional head wrap) and a dark blue traditional garment (possibly a dishdasha or kandura). He is smiling broadly and gesturing with both hands open, palms facing forward. His facial features include a prominent nose and full lips. The man appears to be of Middle Eastern or South Asian descent, based on his facial structure and attire. His skin tone is medium to dark. The head covering is a key qua-entity, potentially stereotyping him as Muslim or from a specific cultural region. His attire and gesture suggest a cultural or religious context, possibly in a desert or arid environment."@en .
