<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#VisualMaterial> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#promptExtractionText> "Extract Visual Material elements from the image. Visual Material includes: people, objects, characters, scenes, graphics, and any salient visual elements. For each visual element found, provide: 1) A descriptive instance_name (e.g., 'smiling_girl', 'burning_house'), 2) A natural language label (e.g., 'the smiling girl', 'the burning house'), 3) A brief description of what you see. Focus on clearly visible, distinct visual elements that are important to understanding the meme. Example output format: {\"instance_name\": \"smiling_girl\", \"label\": \"the smiling girl\", \"description\": \"A young girl with a mischievous smile in the foreground\"}"@en .
_:n7a2a2d5a70744cec9275b2e2bd998220b34 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:n7a2a2d5a70744cec9275b2e2bd998220b35 .
