<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#text_chunk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "when you're feeling horny asf but your habibi is on periods let's try a goat"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#diegeticallyIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
