<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#concept_goat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text suggests 'let's try a goat' as a solution to sexual frustration. This is a crude, absurd, and offensive suggestion that requires understanding of human sexual behavior and the taboo nature of animal-human sexual relations. The concept of using an animal as a substitute for a human partner is a form of shock humor that relies on real-world taboos."@en .
