<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text 'when you're feeling horny asf but your habibi is on periods let's try a goat' implicitly maps the visual entity 'man' as the person experiencing the described scenario. The man's smiling and open-handed gesture, combined with his traditional attire, is used to represent the speaker of the text — a person in a culturally stereotyped context who is humorously resigning to an absurd solution. The visual material (the man) is being mapped onto the textual persona (the 'you' in the text)."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#hasInterrelation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "General property linking a dimension instance to its interrelation with another dimension"@en .
