<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#concept_horny> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The text explicitly references 'feeling horny', which is a concept that requires understanding of human sexuality and emotional states. While not visible in the image, the term is central to the meme's premise and the humor derived from the absurd solution. The concept of sexual frustration is a real-world experience that the meme is satirizing."@en .
