<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01235#assertion_about_01235> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#hasToxicityExplanation> "The meme trivializes a sensitive personal situation (periods) and promotes a crude, animalistic solution, which can be seen as misogynistic and degrading. The visual marker of the man in traditional attire combined with the text creates a harmful stereotype associating Muslim men with sexual behavior involving animals."@en .
